{
  "id": "E167",
  "title": "What a Coincidence",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-11-17",
  "synopsis": "Two friends run into each other in Shanghai.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/579/8153dbbf81444a5e66cccbbfc26ca3f9c6f699b8.mp3?1510593091",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "真是太巧了！\n\n林红：你怎么也在上海？\n杰杰：我来上海出差。你呢？\n林红：我跟朋友一起来旅行。\n杰杰：真是太巧了！\n林红：是啊。你在上海呆几天？\n杰杰：一个星期，这周六晚上的飞机回家。\n林红：我也周六晚上走，不过我们要坐火车。\n杰杰：周六你有时间吗？我们一起吃午饭吧。\n林红：好啊，我跟我朋友说一声。\n杰杰：我得先走了，周六见！",
    "traditional": "真是太巧了！\n\n林紅：你怎麼也在上海？\n杰杰：我來上海出差。你呢？\n林紅：我跟朋友一起來旅行。\n杰杰：真是太巧了！\n林紅：是啊。你在上海呆幾天？\n杰杰：一個星期，這週六晚上的飛機回家。\n林紅：我也週六晚上走，不過我們要坐火車。\n杰杰：週六你有時間嗎？我們一起吃午飯吧。\n林紅：好啊，我跟我朋友說一聲。\n杰杰：我得先走了，週六見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What a coincidence!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "林红：你怎么也在上海？",
      "traditional": "林紅：你怎麼也在上海？",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng nǐ zěn me yě zài shàng hǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: What are you doing here in Shanghai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我来上海出差。你呢？",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我來上海出差。你呢？",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ lái shàng hǎi chū chāi nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: I’m here on a business trip. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "林红：我跟朋友一起来旅行。",
      "traditional": "林紅：我跟朋友一起來旅行。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ gēn péng you yì qǐ lái lǚ xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I’m travelling together with my friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "杰杰：真是太巧了！",
      "traditional": "杰杰：真是太巧了！",
      "pinyin": "jié jié zhēn shì tài qiǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: What a coincidence!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "林红：是啊。你在上海呆几天？",
      "traditional": "林紅：是啊。你在上海呆幾天？",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng shì a nǐ zài shàng hǎi dāi jǐ tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Yes. How long are you going to stay in Shanghai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "杰杰：一个星期，这周六晚上的飞机回家。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：一個星期，這週六晚上的飛機回家。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié yí ge xīng qī zhè zhōu liù wǎn shang de fēi jī huí jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: One week. I’m flying back home this Saturday night."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "林红：我也周六晚上走，不过我们要坐火车。",
      "traditional": "林紅：我也週六晚上走，不過我們要坐火車。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ yě zhōu liù wǎn shang zǒu bú guò wǒ men yào zuò huǒ chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I’m also leaving on Saturday. However, we will take the train."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "杰杰：周六你有时间吗？我们一起吃午饭吧。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：週六你有時間嗎？我們一起吃午飯吧。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié zhōu liù nǐ yǒu shí jiān ma wǒ men yì qǐ chī wǔ fàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Do you have time on Saturday? Let’s have lunch together."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "林红：好啊，我跟我朋友说一声。",
      "traditional": "林紅：好啊，我跟我朋友說一聲。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng hǎo a wǒ gēn wǒ péng you shuō yì shēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Yes, I’ll tell my friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我得先走了，周六见！",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我得先走了，週六見！",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ děi xiān zǒu le zhōu liù jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: I need to go now. See you on Saturday!"
    }
  ],
